			"notes": "## Dynamic Pack Refresher v3.0.0 for Minecraft 26.1.2\n\nPublished 2026-04-16\n\n\n### 🚀 Features\n\n- **Minecraft 26.x support**: Added support for Minecraft 26.1, 26.1.1, and 26.1.2.\n\n### ⚠️ Breaking Changes\n\n- **Forge support dropped**: Forge is not available for Minecraft 26.x. Use the NeoForge build instead.\n- **Java 25 required**: Minecraft 26.x+ requires Java 25 at runtime and build time.\n\n### 🔧 Infrastructure\n\n- Switched to `dev.architectury.loom-no-remap` plugin (Minecraft 26.x is unobfuscated, no mappings needed).\n- Dropped ParchmentMC mappings — no longer applicable without obfuscation.\n- Bumped Architectury plugin to `3.5-SNAPSHOT` and Architectury Loom to `1.14-SNAPSHOT`.\n- Updated CI and devcontainer to Java 25.\n- Updated Shadow plugin to `com.gradleup.shadow:9.3.0`.\n\nFull Changelog: [`v2.1.0...v3.0.0`](https://github.com/42atomys/mc-dynamic-pack-manager/compare/v2.1.0...v3.0.0)"
		},
